{"id":2055,"title":{"romaji":"Netoge no Yome wa Onnanoko ja Nai to Omotta?","english":"And you thought there is never a girl online?","native":"ネトゲの嫁は女の子じゃないと思った?"},"slug":"netoge_no_yome_wa_onnanoko_ja_nai_to_omotta","synopsis":"The story centers on Hideki Nishimura, a young man who confessed to a person he thought was a girl online, only for that person to turn out to be a boy. He keeps this \"black history\" secret and swears to never to trust a \"girl\" online again. However, one day a girl online confesses to him, and it turns out she's actually a beautiful girl named Ako Tamaki. Ako cannot tell the difference between the online world and reality, and she is a loner who has trouble communicating. Hideki and his friends from his guild decide to work together to \"correct\" her.\n\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)","format":"TV","season":"SPRING","year":2016,"createdAt":"2021-03-27 00:44:20","updatedAt":"2021-03-28 05:51:39","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"MAL","externalId":31404},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":21290},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":11319},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":11480},{"site":"ANN","externalId":17514},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":7376},{"site":"OFFICIAL_SITE","externalId":null},{"site":"X","externalId":null},{"site":"CRUNCHYROLL","externalId":null}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":4101,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/9mjxO0bQ6PGgLiFeOevPTIgboT7oMI9iSin1jjEE.png"},{"id":4102,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/XqgC77LwEWZrsJ6eoP1WLPEvilEYlvRqbqfw0vMU.avif"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":137,"name":"Project No.9","slug":"project_no9"}]},"series":{"nodes":[]},"animethemes":[{"id":7049,"slug":"OP1","type":"OP","sequence":null,"song":{"id":7050,"title":{"romaji":"1st Love Story","native":null}},"animethemeentries":[{"id":8180,"version":1,"episodes":null,"nsfw":false,"spoiler":false,"videos":{"nodes":[{"id":7014,"basename":"NetogeNoYome-OP1.webm","filename":"NetogeNoYome-OP1","link":"https://v.animethemes.moe/NetogeNoYome-OP